{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52975","headline":"与郑辕崔全素游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 石笋高 · 薛晏","name":"与郑辕崔全素游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 石笋高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峭笋倚溪壖，雄标屹霞境。\n云披看卷箨，波静见垂影。\n顿翼已栖林，残阳方在顶。\n（同前）（按：三诗原收郑辕、崔全素诗後，题作「同赋」，今重爲拟题。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛晏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}